sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Campaign Manager
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant PE as Policy Engine
    participant SG as Scenario Generator
    participant A as Admin Reviewer
    participant W as Worker
    participant E as Employee

    M->>API: Create draft campaign
    M->>API: Generate scenario
    API->>PE: Validate inputs and allowed themes
    PE-->>API: Constraints
    API->>SG: Generate structured scenario
    SG-->>API: Draft content + metadata
    API->>PE: Post-generation validation
    PE-->>API: Pass or block
    M->>API: Submit for approval
    A->>API: Review diff, edit, approve
    API-->>W: Enqueue sandbox launch
    W->>API: Create delivery attempts and tokens
    E->>API: Open email or scan QR
    API->>API: Track events, assign micro-training, update risk
    A->>API: Export report and audit log
